<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="b459fdcc"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="e2a14783">&lt;p&gt;
    If a package is being used, develop the package application reports according to design specifications, and as
    prioritized by the software development plan. Inform functional design team of any design issues due to technical
    limitations.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    If customized reports are&amp;nbsp;to be&amp;nbsp;developed, ensure that the appropriate development standards are being
    followed.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    As the reports are developed, keep the following in mind:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Basic error handling, messages and audit trail
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Calculation field overflows and errors (e.g. dividing by zero)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Field formatting (layout accuracy, decodes, pagination, headers, footers, tabs, currency, decimals)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Selection criteria all work (WHERE clause completeness)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Calculation correctness (summation and grouping)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Time/date/user stamps complete
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Printing and downloading if specified
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Sufficiently commented code
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
